InputProps?: Partial<BaseInputProps>
```
`Partial<SomeInterface>` as a prop type — not as the top-level type alias but nested as a prop value. Resolver needs to handle `Partial<T>` in prop type position, not just at the top level.

### Pattern 11 — Cross-file import within package (MUI TextField)
```ts
