## Taxonomy By What We Can Do

### Fully solvable without TypeScript compiler

| Pattern | How |
|---------|-----|
| `Omit<T, K>` at top level | ✅ Already in `CollectedTypeAlias` |
| `Pick<T, K>` at top level | ✅ Already in `CollectedTypeAlias` |
| `Partial<T>` at top level | ✅ Already in `CollectedTypeAlias` |
| `Omit<T, K>` nested in intersection | New resolver case — expand then subtract |
| `Partial<Interface>` as prop value type | New resolver case — mark all fields optional |
| Discriminated union of interfaces | Merge with discriminant prop surfaced clearly |
| `(string & {})` | Normalize to `string` in type stringifier |
| Template literals with literal union args | Expand statically: `` `compact-${Size}` `` → full union |
| Inline object type `{ from: string; deg?: number }` | Parse at extract time → `PropType::Object` |
| `declare const X: ForwardRefExoticComponent<P & RefAttributes<E>>` | New extractor pattern for `.d.ts` |
| Render prop union `T \| ((state: S) => T)` | New `PropType::RenderProp { state_type, return_type }` |
| ARIA `boolean \| "true" \| "false"` | Emit as `Union([Boolean, StringLiteral("true"), StringLiteral("false")])` — correct as-is |
| `React.CSSProperties["justifyContent"]` | Recognize indexed access on known types → string |
| `Partial<T>` as prop value (not top-level) | Expand T, mark all optional |

### Partially solvable — degrade gracefully with good diagnostic

| Pattern | Approach |
|---------|---------|
| `NonNullable<Type["key"]>` | Nested: resolve inner first if possible, then apply NonNullable |
| `Type["key"]` on unknown type | `Opaque { raw: "Type[\"key\"]", reason: IndexedAccess }` |
| Complex template literals | Expand if both sides resolvable, else `Opaque { reason: TemplateLiteral }` |
| `(theme: T) => CSSProperties` function type | `EventHandler`-like: `Callable { args: ["theme: Theme"], returns: "CSSProperties" }` |

### Needs typescript-go — always Opaque in v1

| Pattern | Why |
|---------|-----|
| `SxProps<T>` (conditional array union) | Recursive conditional type |
| `ReturnType<typeof fn>` | Needs type evaluation |
| `Parameters<typeof fn>[0]` | Same |
| Complex mapped types | Need type checker |

